2:T43d,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why is Google Gemini trending with +1550% search growth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Google Gemini has seen massive search breakout due to the rollout of Gemini 2.5 and 3.0 Flash, offering million-token context windows, lightning-fast inference, and deep integration across Google Workspace and Android."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Claude AI compare to ChatGPT for daily planning?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude AI excels at natural language nuances, structured markdown generation, and maintaining complex schedule constraints, while ChatGPT models offer rapid multi-task decomposition and high reasoning throughput."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will PlanBot let users choose between Gemini, Claude, and ChatGPT?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PlanBot evaluates leading AI models based on schedule latency, battery efficiency, and reasoning quality. Community poll results directly influence our model integration pipeline."}}]}a:["slug","google-gemini-vs-claude-vs-chatgpt-planbot-poll","d"]
